# ============================================================================
# gpu_enums.ludic — the renderer's vocabulary for texture formats, filters, wrap modes,
# blend factors, depth functions and the like. gpu.ludic takes these as plain ints; what
# each one means is the backend's to decide (gpu_vk_res.ludic maps them to Vulkan's
# formats, filters and blend factors). The values are fixed: do not renumber them.
# ============================================================================

